  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den namibiska finansinspektionen (NAMFISA) s&#xf6;ker 2.5 miljoner f&#xf6;r den initiala fasen 2012-2013 av projektet Finansiell Tillsyn i Namibia.   Projektets &#xf6;vergripande syfte &#xe4;r att bist&#xe5; NAMFISA i sin              utveckling.till en professionell &#xf6;vervakningsmyndighet f&#xf6;r finansiell riskbaserad tillsyn. Den svenska samarbetsparten &#xe4;r                   Finansinspektionen. En viktig l&#xe4;nk &#xe4;r att knyta en internationell exp</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Namibia Financial Supervisory Authority (NAMFISA) is seeking 2.5      million SEK for 2012-2013 for the initial phase of a longer           project.The project &quot;Financial supervision in Namibia&quot; aiming to      enable and improve NAMFISA in its development work into a modern      supervisory authority for risk based financial supervision. Technical assistance by an international expert is needed in regard to NAMFISA&#xb4;</narrative>
  </description>
